### 查询用户总数（先跑这个，记住当前值）
GET http://localhost:8080/users/count

### 新增一个用户
POST http://localhost:8080/users?nickname=zhaoliu&schoolNo=2023004

### 查询所有用户
GET http://localhost:8080/users
### 修改存在的用户
PUT http://localhost:8080/users/3?nickname=xiaowang&credit=95

### 修改不存在的用户
PUT http://localhost:8080/users/9999?nickname=abc&credit=50
### 删除用户
DELETE http://localhost:8080/users/4

### 查被删的用户
GET http://localhost:8080/users/4
### 发布商品
POST http://localhost:8080/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sellerId": 1,
  "title": "二手自行车",
  "description": "骑了一年，有轻微划痕",
  "price": 199.00,
  "categoryId": 2,
  "tradePlace": "3号楼",
  "conditionLevel": 8
}
### 列表（全部）
GET http://localhost:8080/items

### 列表（只看分类 2）
GET http://localhost:8080/items?categoryId=2

### 列表（不存在的分类 99）
GET http://localhost:8080/items?categoryId=99

### 总数（全部）
GET http://localhost:8080/items/count

### 总数（分类 2）
GET http://localhost:8080/items/count?categoryId=2
### 下架商品 1
PUT http://localhost:8080/items/1/status?status=3

### 看列表（应该空了）
GET http://localhost:8080/items

### 上架回来
PUT http://localhost:8080/items/1/status?status=0

### 再看列表（又回来了）
GET http://localhost:8080/items

### 传个非法值
PUT http://localhost:8080/items/1/status?status=99
###
PUT  http://localhost:8080/items/1/status?status=3
###
GET  http://localhost:8080/items
###
GET  http://localhost:8080/items/mine?sellerId=1
###
GET  http://localhost:8080/items/mine?sellerId=999